{
	"_comment": [
		"Cross-language contract for asset-URL canonicalization.",
		"Consumed by the image-resizing service (Rust), the web client (TS) and the Flutter wallet (Dart).",
		"Deployment hosts appear here as example.com placeholders: they are CONFIG, not\n\t\tcontract. Each implementation binds arweaveHosts / directGateways / originalBase\n\t\tfrom its own settings and runs these vectors against them; the rules below are\n\t\twhat must match across languages.",
		"Implementations MUST use string operations only \u2014 no URL-parser round-trips",
		"(parsers normalize differently across languages). Classification may lowercase",
		"the host and strip a leading 'www.'; the verbatim branch must return the input",
		"byte-identical minus everything from the first '#'.",
		"Rules: ipfs://CID[/path] from ipfs:// scheme (incl. malformed ipfs://ipfs/CID)",
		"or any http(s) host whose path starts /ipfs/<valid CID>, or a subdomain",
		"gateway whose host is '<valid CID>.ipfs.<rest>' (origin-isolated gateways put",
		"the CID in the leftmost label; CIDv1 only, since a DNS label can't be",
		"case-sensitive base58). ar://TXID[/path] from",
		"the arweaveHosts list only, first path segment matching txidRegex. gateway.irys.xyz",
		"is deliberately NOT an arweave host: Irys data items live on its own data chain,",
		"so an id that looks like a txid does not resolve on any arweave gateway. Do not",
		"re-add it, and never route an irys URL through an arweave mirror. Query strings",
		"are dropped for both content-addressed families (the id names the bytes);",
		"embedded percent-encoding in kept path segments is preserved verbatim.",
		"originalPath = '/original/' + encodeURIComponent(canonical) \u2014 byte-exact,",
		"same embedding convention as the existing resize path."
	],
	"cidRegex": "^(Qm[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{44}|b[a-z2-7]{50,})$",
	"txidRegex": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{43}$",
	"arweaveHosts": [
		"arweave.example.com",
		"permagate.io",
		"arweave.net"
	],
	"directGateways": {
		"ipfs": "https://ipfs.example.com/ipfs/",
		"arweave": "https://arweave.example.com/"
	},
	"originalBase": "https://images.example.com/original/",
